OL,3,AKnighting Sinfield 'easiest decision
OL,4,Aanyone's had to make,' says Prince
OL,5,AWilliam
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt was his latest endurance challenge
OL,8,Fto raise money for Motor Neurone
OL,9,FDisease (MND) charities following the
OL,10,Fdeath of his friend and former
OL,11,Fteam-mate, Rob Burrow, from the
OL,12,Fcondition in 2024.
OL,14,F"I think frankly he should have been
OL,15,FSir Kevin years ago," said Prince
OL,16,FWilliam.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
