OL,3,ACelebrations in Serbia after veteran
OL,4,Aruler VuDMiDG loses election to
OL,5,Astudent-led protest movement
OL,6,
OL,7,FPreliminary figures from Serbia's
OL,8,Felection commission indicated a record
OL,9,Fhigh turnout, which commentators had
OL,10,Fsuggested would favour the student
OL,11,Fmovement. Celebrations erupted after
OL,12,FVuDMiDG conceded.
OL,14,FVuDMiDG called the snap elections after
OL,15,Ftwo years of protests triggered by the
OL,16,Fcollapse of a train station canopy in
OL,17,Fthe city of Novi Sad, which killed 16
OL,18,Fand was seen as emblematic of
OL,19,Fcorruption and negligence.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
